  "label": "Child Shouting into a Megaphone Stereotype",
  "description": "The image of a child shouting into a megaphone is often used in memes to represent childishness, absurdity, or a lack of seriousness. In this context, it is used to mock Brett Kavanaugh by implying that he is a figure of childish or base behavior, suggesting that his actions or public persona are immature or ridiculous. This stereotype is a common trope in internet culture to diminish or ridicule a person by associating them with something perceived as silly or infantile.",
